	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Die Jahreszahl ergibt sich aus dem Inhalt des Briefes (<placeName ref="l760" cert="high">Solothurnerhandel</placeName>) eindeutig.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note> consolationis plenas, charissime frater, accępi iisque didici, quid pro contione faciundum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sit hisce periculosis temporibus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Profligantur <placeName ref="l760">Salodori</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zur Krise der Reformation in <placeName ref="l760">Solothurn</placeName> <hi>s. Haefliger</hi> 166-199 und oben <ref target="file10314">Nr. 283</ref>. 285. 286. 288.</note> contionatores, ut audio, singuli, adigitur plebs ad <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>suffragia urbis recipienda.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interea multi sua sponte ex oppido aliorsum migrant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Qui vero in urbe sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ita convitiis proscinduntur, ut vix tuto in angulis suis delitescant.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Klopfend und schryend inen vor den hüsern: «<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Verräter, kätzer.»</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Statt in der massen so übel, daß sy selbs, <foreign xml:lang="la">utcunque furiant et insaniant,</foreign> redend, es werde <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nitt mögen bston<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Bestand haben, dauern (<bibl source="b590">SI</bibl> XI 707f).</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Obtruditur nunc <placeName ref="l41">Bernatibus</placeName> tota tragędia, tum quod ab ipsis animati hanc seditionem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ceperint, id quod papistae nimirum ogganniunt, tum a nostris, quod non solum eos deseruerimus, sed desertione <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fidem et verbum prodiderimus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ecce hęc est merces nostra: Quod omni cavere voluimus studio, id nobis impingitur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>In seditione ipsa rumor ille per magnam agri <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> partem spargebatur, nos omnem movere lapidem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 4, 30 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 161f).</note>, ut bellum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>novum excitaremus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Id cum nemo vere de nobis dicere possit, non minus malum nostri nobis impingunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Adde, quod et <persName ref="p18451">pontificem</persName> et <persName ref="p20225">Gallum</persName>, <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanenses</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1195">Eschentalios</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Bewohner des <placeName ref="l1195">Eschentals (Val d'Ossola/Italien)</placeName>.</note>, <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudos</placeName>,<pb type="edition" next="241"/> <placeName ref="l791">Valesianos</placeName> ad arma paratos esse adversum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nos omnes<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>von</hi> omnes <hi>bis</hi> pollicentur <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> palam minantur et pollicentur<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>von</hi> omnes <hi>bis</hi> pollicentur <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, sic tamen, ut <placeName ref="l2448">Antronii</placeName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Ein von <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> oft gebrauchter Spottname für die <placeName ref="l2448">V Orte</placeName>, s. <bibl source="b4">HBBW II</bibl> <ref target="file10110">[Nr. 81]</ref> 88, Anm. 3.</note> bellum non incipiant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sed nos sic lacessunt, ut vel ipsi cogamur pro voto illoru<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>m omnia facere et pati aut primi bello nos tueri, id quod postea in aures agri<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Gemeint ist die Landschaft <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>.</note> susurrabunt, quo eos invitos m<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>agis reddant, qui alioqui ad bella hęc inviti sunt.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vicini nostri <placeName ref="l160">Frib[urgenses]</placeName> - mirum quam illi sitiant sanguinem nostrum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>senatus noster vigilat et omnia agit, ut pacis cupidissimus eam nolentibus resistat.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quodsi apud vos essent dictatores<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Gemeint ist offenbar die nach dem Zweiten <placeName ref="l242">Kappelerkrieg</placeName> aufgehobene Einrichtung der Geheimen Räte in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quemadmodum olim, iam dudum omnia resciretis.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Cum autem tutum non sit nec vobis nec nobis, quod omnia apud vos palam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>aguntur, manet eo firmior simultas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Obsecro sępissime ad me scribas.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Scio utique defectionem filiorum <placeName ref="l3108">Israel</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sub iudicibus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Video subinde multis oppressos annis tyrannide gentium in pęnam nimirum defectionis, a qua cum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>resipiscerent, deum rursum habuerunt propicium<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ri 2, 10-3, 11. 4, 1ff</ref></cit>. 6, 1ff u. ö.</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Scio, quae prophetę aliquando comminati sunt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sed num hęc omnia licet applicare <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nostris temporibus?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Omnia siquidem ad nostram doctrinam scripta sunt, et ad exemplum rerum ante actarum admoneri non est incommodum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Sed quantum promissiones nostrę ante bellum hoc calamitosum<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vor dem Ersten Kappelerkrieg.</note> plebem excitarint, ipse nosti, certe non sine iactura divini verbi, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cum res longe aliter evenerit, quam verbis pro contionę multi sint polliciti.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Quid hic praemii nos manet?</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Gerte id, quod <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Deut. 18 [20] scriptum est.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Hęc certe ex ignorantia, meam quidem fateor, veniunt, quod nescimus uti tam historiis quam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>prophetarum minis et promissionibus.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Nobis crux Christi promittitur, persecutio et impiorum in nos triumphus<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10, 38 par.</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 3, 12</ref></cit>.</note>, <placeName ref="l3108">Israelitis</placeName> victoria, omnia bona terrę, benedictiones adeoq<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ue terra <placeName ref="l3368">Canaan</placeName>, ubi<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>von</hi> ubi <hi>bis</hi> habituri <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> observarint dei praecepta<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 15, 1-21. 17, 1-9</ref></cit> u. a.</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Nos, qui pie vivere volumus in Christo, perpetua persecutio manet.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">In mundo pressuram habituri<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>von</hi> ubi <hi>bis</hi> habituri <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Siehe <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 16, 33</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Confirmabantur Israelitę adversus hostes suos <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>delectu militum, pręsenti et admiranda dei victoria, tametsi fiducię in deum interim admoniti sint.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Nobis vinci ab universo mundo summa promittitur esse victoria.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Nec ullo exemplo probatur, quod ego legerim, christianismum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>unquam feliciter armis et bello defensum.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Si vera est legenda 10 millium martirum<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Zur Legende der 10000 Märtyrer oder Ritter, die auf dem Berg Ararat gekreuzigt wurden, s. Bernhard <hi>Kötting,</hi> in: LThK X 1321.</note>, si vera sunt, quae <persName ref="p17899">Eusebius</persName> in ecclesias<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tica recenset hystoria<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> meint die in der Kirchengeschichte des <persName ref="p17899">Eusebius</persName> vorkommenden Berichte über Märtyrer und Christenverfolgungen.</note> certe nos nulla, quam similis manet victoria, crucis scilicet.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Decem legimus primitiva ecclesię persecutiones<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">In der Kirchengeschichte und der Chronik des <persName ref="p17899">Eusebius</persName> werden zehn Verfolgungen genannt, die <persName ref="p18986">Hieronymus</persName> in seiner Übersetzung der Chronik erstmals durchgehend zählt. Diese Zählung wurde von späteren Autoren immer wieder übernommen, s. Karl <hi>Groß,</hi> in: LThK II 1117f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Quid, si has nobis praesagirem, qui, quod ad doctrinam et externam religionem attinet, primitivę accedimus, quo et fides <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nostra probetur et multorum cordium cogitationes revelentur?</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Tu nunc, charissime frater, videris, quid in hac parte <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>docendum sit, dum scilicet ob nullam aliam causam quam religionem sic lacessimur, ut aut a fide deficere cogamur <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>aut bellico tumultu nos defendere,<pb type="edition" next="242"/> num liceat armis uti aut hosti nos dedere, quandoquidem non omnibus datum est <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>relinquere uxorem, patrem, matrem, liberos, agros et vitam ipsam.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Ab utraque parte pro sua simplicitate <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>urgentur multi ex fratribus et plebe, quibus difficillimum est vel ad arma ob religionem hortari vel dehortari.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Contulimus hęc aliquando pro colloquiis nostris, sed mihi et multis satisfactum nondum est.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">Audiam er<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>go ea in re dominum mihi per <persName ref="p495">Bullingerum</persName> loquentem, ut instructior aliquando sim in functione mea exequenda <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>nec plebem doceam, cui ipse minus fidem adhibeam vel quod ipse nondum didicerim.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Obsecro igitur te per miserationem dei, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quam primum liceat, me huius instituas<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Schon am 17. März 1533 hatte <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> die Meinung <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> zu dieser Problematik erbeten <hi>(s.</hi> oben S. 86, 85-87), und am 30. Dezember 1533 kommt er nochmals darauf zurück (s. unten S. 274, 4-275, 18).</note>.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la">Ante mensem alterum atque alterum effuderam in sinum tuum affectus meos, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quibus cum nihildum responderis, silentio tuo video eos non esse dignos, ut ad respondendum illis occuperis.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Essent adhuc alia, quae te scire vellem, sed satius est obticuisse quam quibusvis cartis committere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Vale et me tibi commendatum amare non desinas.</s>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">Valeant <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName>, <persName ref="p1753">Leo</persName><note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note> et cęteri fratres.</s>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="la">Sed num tu in C<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>horintiis [!] illustrandis progrederis<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kommentar zum 1. Korintherbrief erschien im Juni 1534 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 53).</note>?</s>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Rursum vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="48" xml:lang="la">3. decembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="49" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Philotatus tuus <persName ref="p1391">B. H.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="50" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An Meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>predicanten ze <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>sinem insunders geliepten <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>herren und fründ.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
